Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.74,0:00:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mighty Little Defenders 11 – New Wild Cosmos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Despair and Hope
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Episode 46
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.38,0:12:36.94,end,,0,0,0,,To be continued
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.59,0:00:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you manage to return unscathed after falling into the Bottomless Abyss?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.91,0:00:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.78,0:00:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You’ve grown stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.94,0:00:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What exactly did you go through in the Bottomless Abyss?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.56,0:00:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I’ll tell you exactly what I went through.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.08,0:00:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone else has fallen down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.83,0:01:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,He’s waking up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.23,0:01:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.51,0:01:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,W-what is this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.31,0:01:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,My hands…my body…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.55,0:01:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.43,0:01:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down first.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.95,0:01:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, let’s invite Brother Dahuang to answer your questions and clear up your confusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.31,0:01:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother Dahuang?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.42,0:01:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello there. I’m Brother Dahuang.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.75,0:01:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m the wisest one around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.19,0:01:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever questions you have, I can answer them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.67,0:01:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,A cockroach that can talk? Stay away from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.54,0:01:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you calling a cockroach? Honestly…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.99,0:01:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m a resident of this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.23,0:01:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.43,0:01:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You said you’re a resident…But why do you look like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.94,0:01:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,And besides…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.06,0:01:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Why live in a place like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.63,0:01:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I forgot! I only remember falling and ending up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.18,0:01:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, anyone who falls from above into the abyss…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.54,0:01:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,gradually loses their physical features as they fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.78,0:01:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Before falling into this Bottomless Abyss,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.19,0:02:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,we had whole bodies, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.22,0:02:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But as time went by,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.10,0:02:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,our bodies slowly faded away
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.26,0:02:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,until we became like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.42,0:02:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t cry…please don’t cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.51,0:02:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,My head is in such a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.58,0:02:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,How…how exactly did I fall in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.20,0:02:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Why can’t I remember anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.59,0:02:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Will I end up looking like you guys too?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.03,0:02:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re actually quite lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.75,0:02:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Usually, anyone who falls into the abyss gets sucked straight into the black hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.35,0:02:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,A black hole?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.71,0:02:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Over here—over here, over here, over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.76,0:02:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This black hole looks pretty quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.04,0:02:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks quiet right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.32,0:02:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,but it erupts periodically.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.48,0:02:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,When it erupts, it sucks up everything in the vicinity.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.28,0:03:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,So, that’s the black hole that sucked me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.80,0:03:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, is it safe for you guys to stay here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.52,0:03:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s actually not safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.43,0:03:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The day before yesterday, the black hole erupted.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.84,0:03:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiao Zhu and his safe house were sucked away.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.24,0:03:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,A few days before that, it was Auntie Green.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.32,0:03:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And then…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.52,0:03:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,So what are we waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.72,0:03:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s get out of this…what was it called? The Heartless…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.91,0:03:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s the Bottomless Abyss.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.43,0:03:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, let’s escape this Bottomless Abyss.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.20,0:03:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Escape?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.12,0:03:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Those who once shared your idea…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.72,0:03:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,now have nothing left here but their names.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.47,0:03:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Their bodies were all sucked into the black hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.52,0:03:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You’d better stop messing around.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.51,0:03:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to reinforce the safe house before the next black hole eruption.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.07,0:03:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Come and help out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.27,0:03:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s how you survive in the Bottomless Abyss.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.34,0:03:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Sparky…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.50,0:03:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I can’t stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.10,0:03:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,My friends are waiting for me…I still have to…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.35,0:03:54.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What was it I had to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.90,0:03:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Why can’t I remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.50,0:03:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,This place slowly eats away at our memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.62,0:04:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,For those of us who’ve stayed too long,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.54,0:04:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,we end up forgetting everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.20,0:04:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I…I can’t forget my friend. I have to leave this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.43,0:04:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to get out of here—and fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.64,0:04:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That was just a trial run; now it’s for real.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.22,0:04:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,He fell down again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.11,0:04:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s there to watch?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.83,0:04:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,He’ll probably give up soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.65,0:05:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you going to keep going?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.37,0:05:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.22,0:05:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You remind me of someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.10,0:05:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Back then, he was just as determined to climb up as you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.25,0:05:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he succeed?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.09,0:05:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,He…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.57,0:05:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.55,0:05:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Regardless of whether that person made it up,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.22,0:05:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I am definitely going to climb up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.06,0:05:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Climbing so high…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.26,0:05:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,There’s no way he’ll make it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.89,0:05:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,He fell back down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.25,0:05:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,See? Just look.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.65,0:05:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You should just give up; the gaps in your body are getting bigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.46,0:05:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,If you keep struggling like this, you’ll soon turn into mere lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.90,0:05:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You’d be better off saving your energy
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.38,0:05:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,to survive the next black hole eruption.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.10,0:05:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s more like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.22,0:05:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Gather some materials and help us build a safe house.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.58,0:05:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I refuse to believe I can’t climb it with this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.10,0:05:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You still haven’t given up?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.58,0:06:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You’ve failed so many times already.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.23,0:06:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Why won’t you just give up?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.83,0:06:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,My friends need me, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.19,0:06:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I absolutely cannot give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.71,0:06:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,“Friends”?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.99,0:06:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that something tasty?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.76,0:06:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,How long do you think it’ll take for him to fall?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.92,0:06:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Definitely no more than ten seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.64,0:06:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,He’s held on for so long this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.35,0:06:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I actually think he might make it to the top this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.32,0:06:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,He’s almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.15,0:06:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.43,0:06:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to see too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.41,0:06:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Sparky!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.53,0:06:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.00,0:06:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.96,0:06:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,He’s so close.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.83,0:06:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,,He fell.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.71,0:06:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.96,0:07:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Sparky is still up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.76,0:07:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.31,0:07:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,He did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.15,0:07:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,He actually made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.65,0:07:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you he’d climb up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.68,0:07:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You never said that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.44,0:07:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I said it in my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.13,0:07:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What is he doing coming down? He’s coming down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.72,0:07:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s wrong with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.08,0:07:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,He’s giving up, obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.56,0:07:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew he’d do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.80,0:07:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,But he was so determined just a moment ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.20,0:07:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s so disappointing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.51,0:07:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You finally made it up there—why are you coming back?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.01,0:08:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I came back to take you all out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.61,0:08:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But we’ve only just met.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.68,0:08:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You don’t need to turn back for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.40,0:08:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Staying here means getting swallowed by the black hole sooner or later.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.36,0:08:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s why I want to take everyone up with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.80,0:08:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the kind offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.15,0:08:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,But we’ll just stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.03,0:08:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,We used to dream of hope, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.59,0:08:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,But every time, we were met only with despair.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.89,0:08:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,We’ve become like this now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.61,0:08:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We no longer dare to hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.20,0:08:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,To give up hope so easily,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.12,0:08:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,what about the family and friends waiting for you outside?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.60,0:08:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Their worry, their hope, their anticipation—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.55,0:08:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,aren’t those the very forces driving us to climb higher?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.63,0:08:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t you want to see them again?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.47,0:08:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But we’ve all lost our memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.88,0:08:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let’s get those memories back together.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.80,0:08:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Every memory of our friends and family
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.72,0:08:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,and all our own memories, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.89,0:09:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Alert! Alert! The black hole is erupting!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.13,0:09:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, hurry to the safe house!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.90,0:09:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s erupting earlier than last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.45,0:09:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Let go of me. You might actually survive if you’re on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.03,0:09:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I can’t do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.31,0:09:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I would never abandon my companions.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.86,0:09:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.46,0:09:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,This…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.15,0:09:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Sparky, forget about us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.31,0:10:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.18,0:10:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You’d have a fighting chance if you escaped on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.26,0:10:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I said I’d get you all out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.35,0:10:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Sparky, your body…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.62,0:10:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry, I can hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.90,0:10:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry, I can hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.58,0:10:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry, I can hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.62,0:10:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I was
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.34,0:10:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,going to take everyone
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.33,0:10:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,take everyone
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.13,0:10:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,to…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.41,0:10:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,…take them where?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.89,0:10:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Why can’t I remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.61,0:10:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What…what am I holding on for?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.86,0:10:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Sparky…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.42,0:10:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Sparky…Sparky
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.34,0:10:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Sparky, over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.46,0:10:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Sparky, just give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.36,0:10:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You can’t catch up on the score with the time left.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.19,0:10:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You never know who’ll win until the very last moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.11,0:10:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.14,0:10:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The hoop here…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.54,0:10:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,has disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.26,0:11:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did everyone go?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.62,0:11:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,How did they all vanish?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.58,0:11:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,1, 2, 3, 4, 5…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.50,0:11:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Great, everyone’s okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.66,0:11:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, I remember I had…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.29,0:11:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.70,0:11:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s great.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.98,0:11:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Sparky.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.14,0:11:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We were so worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.90,0:11:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It was really dangerous back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.54,0:11:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,No wonder I’m still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.62,0:11:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for saving me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.41,0:11:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,No, {\i1}we{\i0} should be thanking {\i1}you{\i0} for saving {\i1}us{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.25,0:11:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s just that the safe house is completely destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.69,0:11:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Since there’s no way back, why not come up with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.72,0:11:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Sparky can get us safely through the black hole eruption.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.92,0:12:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,So maybe he really {\i1}can{\i0} take us up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.80,0:12:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Rest assured, I will definitely get us up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.40,0:12:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,For the sake of the family and friends who are waiting for us.
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
